					"저는 <<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cat") gte 6)>><<genderedTF "cat">><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 6)>><<genderedTF "wolf">><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6)>><<genderedTF "bear">><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6)>><<genderedTF "fox">><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 6)>>하피<</if>>【이】라서요. 날고기를 먹으면 사실 기분이 좋아져요."<br>
				<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
