					"저는 <<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cat") gte 6)>><<genderedTF "cat">><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 6)>><<genderedTF "wolf">><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6)>><<genderedTF "bear">><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6)>><<genderedTF "fox">><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 6)>>하피<</if>>【이】라서요. 아무래도 제 몸에는 그걸로 충분한 이유가 되나 봐요."<br>
				<<elseif (_speechAttitudeResolved is "bratty" or _speechAttitudeResolved is "cruel")>>
					"나 <<if (effectiveTransformationLevel("cat") gte 6)>><<genderedTF "cat">><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("wolf") gte 6)>><<genderedTF "wolf">><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bear") gte 6)>><<genderedTF "bear">><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("fox") gte 6)>><<genderedTF "fox">><<elseif (effectiveTransformationLevel("bird") gte 6)>>하피<</if>>【이】잖아, 뭘 기대한 거야? 고기는 익혔든 안 익혔든 고기야."<br>
				<<else>>
