			<<set $weekly.theft.avery_mansion.Ban to true>>
			<<link [[다음|Kitchen Steal Fight]]>><<set $fightstart to 1>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<elseif $phase is "potato">>
		"날감자라. 한심한 변명이군.
		<<if playerBellyVisible() or knowsAboutPregnancy("pc", "Avery")>>임신해서 당기는 거라 해도 터무니없는 건 달라지지 않아.<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("kitchen")>> 내려놓고 난장판을 치워.<<else>> 내려놔.<</if>> 감자가 먹고 싶으면 익혀 먹어."
			<br><br>
			<<averyKitchenExit "rage">><<averyKitchenPillConsequence>>
			<br><br>
			<<icon "avery-kitchen.png">><<link [[다음|Mansion Kitchen]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<<else>>
